<title>FRANCE: Lagardere sees higher 1997 result.</title>
<headline>Lagardere sees higher 1997 result.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lagardere Group said it expected a rise in its 1997 results, before exceptionals, after a 64.8 percent rise in its 1996 net income to 1.038 billion francs.</p>
<p>&quot;We will maybe not have a rise as strong as in 1996, but we do see a rise,&quot; finance director Philippe Camus told a news conference, adding the profit rise was due to the media and multimedia activties.</p>
</text>
